1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,680
There is a moment usually quiet, usually late when the performance stops making sense.

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:11,520
You have watched someone get torn apart for being real, you have watched the hollow ones

3
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:16,600
get praised and something in you goes still and then cold.

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,200
This poem came from that moment, not rage, clarity.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,960
So let me read it to you first before I say anything about it.

6
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,000
Let it land on its own.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Making up to a realization about how the world is changing, thoughts driven by exteriority,
